From 53ddb5562eb4cfdb15a6b4a55a682eee831d5604 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Gazelka <andrew.gazelka@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 04:49:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] libstore: persist delete traversal across bounded slices

Add a versioned, fsynced LocalStore checkpoint for bounded
gcDeleteSpecific referrer traversal. Each process refreshes roots
before resuming, and deletion begins only after traversal completes.

Cover both a three-path cross-process resume and a root introduced
between slices.
